# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CivicAgent — repository now intentionally contains ONLY README.md.
# Everything else lives locally (never tracked). This keeps the GitHub repo
# clean and prevents local code from being committed accidentally.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything by default …
*

# … except the two files we keep in the repository:
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Guardrail: never let these sneak in even if explicitly un-ignored.
.env
.env.*